label story_04_complete (Roots Beneath Blackwater Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): The Aether Bloom remembers the road. I can taste old rain in it, old root-speech, old fear folded carefully beneath the forest floor.
"Dianthus Core": Dusk Forest was not hiding Veld from us. It was hiding us from Veld until we could understand what darkness is, and what the Void only pretends to be.
"Dianthus Core": The forest has remembered where the road goes. Follow it into the Ruins of Veld, and do not mistake the stones for silence.
"Dianthus Core": Something beneath them has been answering the night. Bring back its name before it learns ours.
